{"RukuNumber":213,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":14,"SurahIndex":"014","VerseNumber":13,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَقَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ لِرُسُلِهِمۡ لَنُخۡرِجَنَّكُم مِّنۡ أَرۡضِنَآ أَوۡ لَتَعُودُنَّ فِي مِلَّتِنَاۖ فَأَوۡحَىٰٓ إِلَيۡهِمۡ رَبُّهُمۡ لَنُهۡلِكَنَّ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","TajweedText":"وَقَالَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> لِرُسُلِهِمْ لَنُخْرِجَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َك<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّنْ أَرْضِن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَوْ لَتَعُودُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ فِى مِلَّتِنَا‌ۖ فَأَوْحَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ىٰٓ</tajweed> إِلَيْهِمْ رَبُّهُمْ لَنُهْلِكَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>ظَّ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٣</span>","End":"١٣","PageNumber":257,"JuzNumber":13,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":213,"MaqraNumber":103,"HizbNumber":26,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":14,"SurahIndex":"014","VerseNumber":14,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَنُسۡكِنَنَّكُمُ ٱلۡأَرۡضَ مِنۢ بَعۡدِهِمۡۚ ذَٰلِكَ لِمَنۡ خَافَ مَقَامِي وَخَافَ وَعِيدِ","TajweedText":"وَلَنُسْكِنَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضَ م<tajweed class=iqlab>ِنۢ ب</tajweed>َعْدِهِمْ‌ۚ ذ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِكَ لِمَنْ خَافَ مَقَامِى وَخَافَ وَع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>د</tajweed>ِ <span class=end>١٤</span>","End":"١٤","PageNumber":257,"JuzNumber":13,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":213,"MaqraNumber":103,"HizbNumber":26,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":14,"SurahIndex":"014","VerseNumber":15,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَٱسۡتَفۡتَحُواْ وَخَابَ كُلُّ جَبَّارٍ عَنِيدٖ","TajweedText":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>